#. Tag: title
#: using-selections.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Unselecting</title>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-selections.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All the selection paint tools have an option to add or subtract from the "
"selection. This means that you can use all your familiar tools to both "
"select and unselect. There is also a true selection eraser among the "
"selection paint tools."
msgstr ""

